From f37935576c0834143ea8f2a2c39afaf4bba80f20 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nicole Muzzin <nicole@muzz.in>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 05:58:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] script: reuse parsed selectors in querySelector, matches and
 closest

Each call parsed its selector string again, and scripts tend to call
these in loops with a handful of strings. The document now keeps the
parsed lists by string, cleared when its URL changes (parsing depends on
it) and bounded at 256 entries like Blink's SelectorQueryCache.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
